        "anchor": [
          1420,
          9204.8,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "Adam divides by the gradient's own size,\nso a 1e-7 rounding can move a weight\nby a fraction of a step",
      "originalText": "Adam divides by the gradient's own size,\nso a 1e-7 rounding can move a weight\nby a fraction of a step",
